{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Xf3W4vGwKdNhVjH18r9Ubs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V3V4aGgiShvdEDwew5iwpU","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Explore tank_core types","subagent_type":"Explore","prompt":"Thoroughly explore the tank_core crate at /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/. I need to verify these specific requirements from the project spec:\n\n1. **Public API types**: Check that `SimSeed`, `PlayerAction`, `SimulationEngine` trait, `TankSnapshot`, `TankState`, `SimEvent`, `EventSeverity`, `EventKind`, `EventCause` all exist with the right variants.\n   - PlayerAction must have ALL these variants: Feed, WaterChangePercent, TrimPlants, SiphonDetritus, CleanFilter, AddShrimp, RemoveShrimp, ChangePhotoperiod, ChangeLightIntensity, ChangeHeaterSetpoint, ChangeAmbientTemperature, ChangeAeration\n   - EventKind must have ALL these: CycleProgressing, AmmoniaWarning, NitriteWarning, OxygenDip, AlgaeRiskRising, AlgaeBloom, BiofilmMaturityIncrease, ShrimpBerried, EggFailure, MoltStressWarning, FilterCleaningSetback, SubstrateFoulingWarning, StabilityImproving\n   - SimulationEngine trait must have: apply_action, step_hours, snapshot, full_state\n\n2. **TankGeometry**: Must have length_cm, width_cm, height_cm, fill_height_cm, glass_thickness_mm, open_top fields. Check derived calculations.\n\n3. **State tracking**: Verify ALL required dissolved pools exist:\n   - ammonia_total_mg_n_total, nitrite_mg_n_total, nitrate_mg_n_total, phosphate_mg_p_total\n   - dissolved_oxygen_mg_total, dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total\n   - dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total, dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total\n   - alkalinity_meq_total\n   - ions: Ca, Mg, Na, K, HCO3, Cl, SO4 as total mg\n\n4. **TankSnapshot derived display values**: tan_mg_l, nh3_mg_l, nitrite_mg_l, nitrate_mg_l, phosphate_mg_l, do_mg_l, gh_d, kh_d, tds_mg_l, conductivity_us_cm, ph\n\n5. **Substrate**: Check 1-3 layers, kinds: inert_sand, inert_gravel, active_planted, coarse_porous\n\n6. **Plants**: FastStem and RootFeedingRosette guilds\n\n7. **Shrimp state**: adults, juveniles, berried_females, condition 0..1, molt_stress 0..1, reproductive_readiness 0..1, egg_progress_days\n\n8. **Event storage**: At least last 200 events in state, TankSnapshot exposes last 20\n\n9. **Deterministic RNG**: ChaCha8Rng or similar, stored in state\n\n10. **Save/load**: JSON format with schema_version, app_version, full TankState, queued actions, RNG state\n\nRead the lib.rs, types/ directory, engine.rs, save.rs, rng.rs files thoroughly."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":637,"cache_read_input_tokens":25153,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":637},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49fc8440-ef1d-426c-844e-0d9d2eefdcf5","uuid":"f83a9c84-bce3-4a25-bb83-89629dbb8949"}
