{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Xf3W4vGwKdNhVjH18r9Ubs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Xhn8tPf3EszcA61KpdTdTL","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Explore TUI and data crates","subagent_type":"Explore","prompt":"Thoroughly explore the TUI and data crates at /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_tui/ and /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/. Also check /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_scenarios/. Verify:\n\n1. **TUI screens**: Must have Overview, Chemistry, Biology, Actions, Log screens\n   - Overview: day/hour, temp, pH, DO, TAN, NH3, nitrite, nitrate, plant status, shrimp status, warnings\n   - Chemistry: chemistry details and recent trends\n   - Biology: plants, algae/periphyton, shrimp, biofilter maturity\n   - Actions: forms for feed, water change, trim, siphon, clean filter, add/remove shrimp, change light, change heater, change ambient temp\n   - Log: chronological event list\n\n2. **TUI controls**: step 1 hour, step 1 day, step 1 week, pause/autoadvance, save/load, quit\n\n3. **TUI architecture**: Must only use TankSnapshot + action dispatch, not direct state mutation\n\n4. **Data presets (TOML)**:\n   - Source water: soft_acidic, moderate, hard_shrimp, ro_like\n   - Substrate: inert_sand, inert_gravel, active_planted, coarse_porous\n   - Plants: fast_stem, root_rosette\n   - Shrimp: neocaridina_davidi\n   - Process parameters: one default pack\n   - Scenarios: nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room\n   - Each must have id, name, parameter values, optional provenance block\n\n5. **Scenarios crate**: scenario fixtures for regression tests and manual play\n\n6. **Startup configuration**: User can choose tank size, fill height, substrate, source water, plants, filter, light, heater, shrimp count\n\nRead all source files in these crates and check for the data preset files (TOML)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"