{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CMvmcYFZWC3fhZps9REzW1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QF2vsntjDVHcTNrk9CgJR6","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Explore simulation systems","subagent_type":"Explore","prompt":"Thoroughly explore the simulation systems in /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/systems/. I need to verify the following required systems are properly implemented:\n\n1. **Temperature system**: \n   - dt_s = 3600.0, heat_capacity from volume * 4186.0\n   - UA from k_surface * surface_area + k_wall * wall_area with open_top factor\n   - Heater logic: only heats when below setpoint - deadband/2, never cools\n   - delta_temp update formula\n\n2. **Nitrogen cycle**:\n   - Full pathway: feed -> particulate organics -> dissolved organics -> TAN -> nitrite -> nitrate\n   - Detritus pools (particulate and fine)\n   - DOC and DON pools\n   - Decomposer biomass\n   - Nitrifier guilds: ammonia oxidizers, nitrite oxidizers, comammox\n   - Monod-style rates with vmax, biomass, f_temp, f_pH, f_do, substrate/(k+substrate)\n   - 4.57 mg O2 per 1 mg N nitrified\n   - Rate clamps preventing over-consumption\n\n3. **NH3 speciation**:\n   - pKa = 0.09018 + 2729.92 / (273.2 + temp_c)\n   - fraction_nh3 = 1.0 / (1.0 + 10.0^(pKa - ph))\n\n4. **Dissolved oxygen**:\n   - DO saturation from linear interpolation (0C->14.6, 10C->11.3, 20C->9.1, 30C->7.6)\n   - Reaeration, photosynthesis, respiration, nitrification O2 cost\n\n5. **pH and alkalinity**:\n   - pH from alkalinity and DIC formula: 6.3 + log10(alk) - log10(dic)\n   - Alkalinity consumption: 0.1428 meq per 1 mg N nitrified\n   - Nitrification/photosynthesis/respiration effects on DIC\n\n6. **Plants**: Growth depends on light, temp, N, P, C, habitat_factor, crowding\n   - FastStem from water column, RootFeedingRosette from substrate\n\n7. **Algae/periphyton**: suspended algae and periphyton biomass\n\n8. **Shrimp**: condition, molt_stress, reproduction, mortality\n   - Reproduction temp anchor: best 22-26C, worse by 30C, near-zero by 33C\n\n9. **Microfauna**: aggregate grazing index with ecological effects\n\n10. **Update order**: Verify the hourly pipeline order matches spec (apply actions -> volume -> mix -> temp -> light -> feed -> decomposition -> nitrification -> DIC/alk/pH -> DO -> plants -> shrimp stress -> events -> derived)\n\nList all system files and read through the key implementations."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":736,"cache_read_input_tokens":29000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":736},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49fc8440-ef1d-426c-844e-0d9d2eefdcf5","uuid":"60fedc30-9172-4f05-b29a-a975d97aa941"}
