HighTemperature, LowMinerals, BiofilterImmature, SurfaceExchangeRestricted, HighNutrients, PlantCrowding, SurfaceSaturation, SubstrateExhausted, ChemistryInstability, Starvation, PoorCondition\n\n**EventSeverity Variants - ALL 3 PRESENT:**\nInfo, Warning, Critical\n\n**SimulationEngine Trait Methods - ALL 4 PRESENT:**\n- `apply_action(&mut self, action: PlayerAction) -> Result<(), SimError>`\n- `step_hours(&mut self, hours: u32) -> Result<(), SimError>`\n- `snapshot(&self) -> TankSnapshot`\n- `full_state(&self) -> &TankState`\n\n### 2. TANKGEOMETRY - ALL FIELDS VERIFIED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/geometry.rs`\n\n**Fields:**\n- `length_cm: f64` ✓\n- `width_cm: f64` ✓\n- `height_cm: f64` ✓\n- `fill_height_cm: f64` ✓\n- `glass_thickness_mm: f64` ✓\n- `open_top: bool` ✓\n\n**Derived Calculations (implemented as methods):**\n- `water_volume_l()` → calculates length × width × fill_height / 1000\n- `surface_area_cm2()` → calculates length × width\n- `footprint_area_cm2()` → calculates length × width\n- `wall_area_cm2()` → calculates 2 × fill_height × (length + width)\n- `mean_depth_cm()` → returns fill_height\n- `surface_area_to_volume_ratio()` → computes surface_area / volume_l\n- `wall_area_to_volume_ratio()` → computes wall_area / volume_l\n- `top_exchange_factor()` → 1.0 if open_top, else clamped lid_exchange_factor\n- Default: 40×25×25cm with 22cm fill height, 5mm glass, open top\n\n### 3. STATE TRACKING - ALL DISSOLVED POOLS VERIFIED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/water.rs`\n\n**WaterState contains ALL required fields:**\n\n**Nitrogen/Phosphorus:**\n- `ammonia_total_mg_n_total: f64` ✓\n- `nitrite_mg_n_total: f64` ✓\n- `nitrate_mg_n_total: f64` ✓\n- `phosphate_mg_p_total: f64` ✓\n\n**Gases & Carbon:**\n- `dissolved_oxygen_mg_total: f64` ✓\n- `dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total: f64` ✓\n- `dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total: f64` ✓\n- `dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total: f64` ✓\n\n**Alkalinity & Ions:**\n- `alkalinity_meq_total: f64` ✓\n- `calcium_mg_total: f64` ✓ (Ca)\n- `magnesium_mg_total: f64` ✓ (Mg)\n- `sodium_mg_total: f64` ✓ (Na)\n- `potassium_mg_total: f64` ✓ (K)\n- `bicarbonate_mg_total: f64` ✓ (HCO3)\n- `chloride_mg_total: f64` ✓ (Cl)\n- `sulfate_mg_total: f64` ✓ (SO4)\n- `temperature_c: f64` ✓\n- `ph: f64` ✓\n\n**Helper method:**\n- `total_tracked_ions_mg()` → sums Ca, Mg, Na, K, HCO3, Cl, SO4\n\n### 4. TANKSNAPSHOT DERIVED DISPLAY VALUES - ALL VERIFIED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs`\n\nAll computed fields present in TankSnapshot:\n- `tan_mg_l: f64` ✓ (computed: ammonia_total / volume_l)\n- `nh3_mg_l: f64` ✓ (computed: compute_nh3_mg_l using tan, pH, temperature)\n- `nitrite_mg_l: f64` ✓\n- `nitrate_mg_l: f64` ✓\n- `phosphate_mg_l: f64` ✓\n- `do_mg_l: f64` ✓\n- `gh_d: f64` ✓ (computed: (2.497 × ca_mg_l + 4.118 × mg_mg_l) / 17.848)\n- `kh_d: f64` ✓ (computed: (alkalinity_meq_l × 50) / 17.848)\n- `tds_mg_l: f64` ✓ (computed: total_tracked_ions / volume_l)\n- `conductivity_us_cm: f64` ✓ (computed: tds_mg_l / 0.65)\n- `ph: f64` ✓\n\nPlus many additional fields for ecosystem state display.\n\n### 5. SUBSTRATE - ALL VARIANTS AND FIELDS VERIFIED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/substrate.rs`\n\n**SubstrateKind Enum - ALL 4 VARIANTS:**\n1. `InertSand` ✓\n2. `InertGravel` ✓\n3. `ActivePlanted` ✓\n4. `CoarsePorous` ✓\n\n**SubstrateLayerState - Supports 1-3 layers:**\nTankState stores `substrate_layers: Vec<SubstrateLayerState>` with flexible layer count. Default creates 1 layer, seeded_example creates 2 layers.\n\n**Layer Fields:**\n- `kind: SubstrateKind` ✓\n- `depth_cm: f64` ✓\n- `nutrient_store_mg_n_total: f64` ✓\n- `nutrient_store_mg_p_total: f64` ✓\n- `cation_exchange_capacity_index: f64` ✓\n- `detritus_trapping_index: f64` ✓\n- `colonizable_area_cm2: f64` ✓\n- `low_oxygen_tendency_index: f64` ✓\n- `grazing_surface_index: f64` ✓\n\n### 6. PLANTS - BOTH GUILDS PRESENT\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs`\n\n**PlantGuild Enum:**\n1. `FastStem` ✓\n2. `RootFeedingRosette` ✓\n\n**PlantGuildState contains:**\n- `guild: PlantGuild`\n- `biomass_g: f64`\n- `health_index: f64`\n- `crowding_index: f64`\n- `habitat_index: f64`\n\nDefault TankState initializes both guilds with appropriate starting biomass and health.\n\n### 7. SHRIMP STATE - ALL FIELDS AND RANGES VERIFIED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs`\n\n**AnimalState fields:**\n- `adults_count: u32` ✓\n- `juveniles_count: u32` ✓\n- `berried_females_count: u32` ✓\n- `condition_index: f64` (0..1 range, default 0.8) ✓\n- `molt_stress_index: f64` (0..1 range, default 0.1) ✓\n- `reproductive_readiness_index: f64` (0..1 range, default 0.4) ✓\n- `egg_progress_days: f64` ✓\n\n**Additional Shrimp Tracking:**\n- `egg_cohorts: Vec<EggCohort>` for per-cohort tracking\n- `hourly_nh3_stress_accum`, `hourly_nitrite_stress_accum`, `hourly_low_do_stress_accum`, `hourly_heat_stress_accum`, `hourly_instability_stress_accum`\n- `daily_food_consumed_g` for consumption tracking\n\n**ShrimpRuntimeParams (species-specific, materialized in state):**\n- Stores optimal_temp_min/max, gh_min/max, base_spawn_rate, egg_duration_days, hatch_success_base, juvenile_sensitivity, high_temp_repro_penalty parameters\n\n### 8. EVENT STORAGE - VERIFIED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/state.rs` and `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs`\n\n- **TankState stores:** `event_log: Vec<SimEvent>` (unlimited, but capped at 200 by invariants) ✓\n- **Invariant enforcement** (invariants.rs lines 135-137):\n  - Maintains last 200 events in state.event_log\n  - When > 200 events, drains oldest to keep exactly 200\n- **TankSnapshot:** `recent_events: Vec<SimEvent>` exposes last 20 events ✓\n  - Implementation: takes last 20 from event_log, reverses to chronological order\n\n### 9. DETERMINISTIC RNG - VERIFIED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/rng.rs`\n\n- **RNG Type:** `ChaCha8Rng` from rand_chacha crate ✓\n- **Seed Type:** `SimSeed(u64)` ✓\n- **SimRng struct contains:**\n  - `seed: SimSeed`\n  - `draws: u64` (tracks number of random draws)\n  - `rng: ChaCha8Rng` (underlying generator)\n- **Determinism:** Fully deterministic via seed + draw count\n- **Serialization:** Custom Serialize/Deserialize implementation using SimRngRepr\n  - Stores seed and draws count, reconstructs RNG state on load\n- **Methods:** `next_u64()`, `next_f64()`, seed recovery\n\n### 10. SAVE/LOAD - FULLY IMPLEMENTED\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/save.rs`\n\n**SaveFile struct:**\n```\npub struct SaveFile {\n    pub schema_version: u32,          // SCHEMA_VERSION = 2\n    pub app_version: String,          // APP_VERSION from Cargo.toml\n    pub state: TankState,             // Full serialized state\n    pub queued_actions: Vec<PlayerAction>,  // Pending actions\n}\n```\n\n**JSON Format:** ✓\n- Serializes with serde to pretty JSON\n- `SaveFile::to_json_pretty()` method\n- `SaveFile::from_json()` method with schema version validation\n\n**RNG State Persistence:** ✓\n- SimRng is serialized as part of TankState\n- Reconstructs exact RNG state on load via seed + draws\n\n**Methods:**\n- `SaveFile::new()` → create from state + actions\n- `SaveFile::from_engine()` → extract SaveFile from Engine\n- `SaveFile::to_json_pretty()` → serialize to JSON string\n- `SaveFile::from_json()` → deserialize with validation\n- `SaveFile::into_engine()` → reconstruct Engine from save file\n\n---\n\n## SUMMARY\n\n**VERIFICATION RESULT: ALL 10 REQUIREMENTS MET**\n\nEvery single specification requirement has been implemented and correctly exposed through the public API:\n\n1. All public API types exist with complete variant sets\n2. TankGeometry has all required fields and derived calculations\n3. All dissolved pools are tracked in WaterState\n4. TankSnapshot provides all derived display values\n5. Substrate system supports multiple layers with all required kinds\n6. Both plant guilds (FastStem, RootFeedingRosette) are present\n7. Shrimp state tracks all required metrics in correct ranges\n8. Event storage maintains 200-event buffer with 20-event snapshot exposure\n9. Deterministic RNG (ChaCha8Rng) is properly seeded and stored\n10. Save/load system fully implements JSON serialization with schema versioning and RNG state preservation\n\n**Key Files:**\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/lib.rs` - public exports\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs` - type re-exports\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs` - SimulationEngine trait implementation\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/` - all type definitions\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/save.rs` - persistence layer\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/rng.rs` - RNG implementation\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs` - event log capping"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a0d112a7c9edb5c62 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 52264\ntool_uses: 21\nduration_ms: 58595</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49fc8440-ef1d-426c-844e-0d9d2eefdcf5","uuid":"5bd665d1-41dc-4f7f-9916-0cbd54da3da6","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Thoroughly explore the tank_core crate at /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/. I need to verify these specific requirements from the project spec:\n\n1. **Public API types**: Check that `SimSeed`, `PlayerAction`, `SimulationEngine` trait, `TankSnapshot`, `TankState`, `SimEvent`, `EventSeverity`, `EventKind`, `EventCause` all exist with the right variants.\n   - PlayerAction must have ALL these variants: Feed, WaterChangePercent, TrimPlants, SiphonDetritus, CleanFilter, AddShrimp, RemoveShrimp, ChangePhotoperiod, ChangeLightIntensity, ChangeHeaterSetpoint, ChangeA