n3. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/source_water/hard_shrimp.toml` ✓\n4. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/source_water/ro_like.toml` ✓\n\n**Substrate Presets** (4 required):\n1. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/substrate/inert_sand.toml` ✓\n2. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/substrate/inert_gravel.toml` ✓\n3. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/substrate/active_planted.toml` ✓\n4. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/substrate/coarse_porous.toml` ✓\n\nEach has: id, name, depth_cm, cation_exchange_capacity_index, detritus_trapping_index, colonizable_area_factor, low_oxygen_tendency_index, grazing_surface_index, nutrient_charge_mg_n_total, nutrient_charge_mg_p_total, provenance block\n\n**Plant Presets** (2 required):\n1. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/plants/fast_stem.toml` ✓\n2. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/plants/root_rosette.toml` ✓\n\nEach has: id, name, guild, growth_rate_index, water_column_uptake_bias, substrate_uptake_bias, provenance block\n\n**Shrimp Presets** (1 required):\n1. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/shrimp/neocaridina_davidi.toml` ✓\n   - id, name, species, optimal_temp_min/max_c, gh_min/max_d\n   - base_spawn_rate, egg_duration_days, hatch_success_base\n   - juvenile_sensitivity, high_temp_repro_penalty_start/full_c\n   - Provenance block\n\n**Process Parameters Preset** (1 default pack required):\n1. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/process/default.toml` ✓\n   - Comprehensive process coefficients for nitrogen cycle, decomposer kinetics, AOB/NOB/comammox kinetics\n   - Plant growth parameters, algae/periphyton parameters, shrimp dynamics, microfauna turnover\n   - Provenance block\n\n**Scenario Presets** (3 required):\n1. `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/scenarios/nano_cycle.toml` ✓\n   - id: \"nano_cycle\", name: \"Nano Cycle\"\n   - source_water_id: \"soft_acidic\"\n   - substrate_ids: [\"inert_sand\"]\n   - plan