rs12 (lines 118-146)\n- `StartupHeaterPreset`: Off, Celsius24, Celsius25, Celsius26 (lines 148-176)\n\n`StartupOverrides` struct (lines 178-205) allows overriding:\n- Geometry (size_scale, fill_ratio)\n- source_water_profile_id\n- substrate_preset, plant_selection\n- filter_enabled, light_preset, heater_preset, aeration_enabled\n- initial_adult_shrimp_count\n\n**Scenario Materialization** (lines 438-509):\nThe system builds complete TankState with:\n- Geometry from scenario\n- Initial water state from source-water profile × fill volume\n- Source-water catalog populated with all known presets\n- Substrate layers from scenario preset IDs\n- Plant guilds from scenario preset IDs\n- Process parameters from scenario preset\n- Environment (ambient temperature)\n- SimMeta with scenario_id and notes\n\n**Tests verify:**\n- `nano_cycle_materializes_correctly()` - checks dimensions, volume, ambient temp, initial chemistry, substrate/plant guilds\n- `medium_planted_materializes_with_two_substrates_and_plants()` - verifies two-substrate and two-plant setups\n- `warm_room_materializes_with_high_ambient()` - confirms 29°C ambient\n- `startup_overrides_apply_heater_and_initial_shrimp()` - verifies heater settings and shrimp count override\n- `startup_overrides_replace_source_water_profile()` - confirms source water replacement affects chemistry\n\n---\n\n### 6. STARTUP CONFIGURATION - VERIFIED\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_tui/src/main.rs`\n\nThe startup UI (lines 112-632) presents a multi-field selection menu covering:\n\n**Configurable Parameters:**\n1. Scenario (choose from default_scenario_ids)\n2. Tank size (TANK_SIZE_PRESETS: Compact/Baseline/Large - scales 0.8/1.0/1.25)\n3. Fill height (FILL_PRESETS: 75%/90%/100%)\n4. Source water (soft_acidic, moderate, hard_shrimp, ro_like)\n5. Substrate (inert_sand, inert_gravel, active_planted, active_planted + coarse_porous)\n6. Plants (FastStem only, RootFeedingRosette only, Both guilds, None)\n7. Filter (On/Off)\n8. Light photoperiod (6h/8h/10h/12h)\n9. Heater (Off/24°C/25°C/26°C)\n10. Aeration (On/Off)\n11. Initial shrimp count (0, 5, 10, 15, 20)\n12. Launch button\n\nThe selection system:\n- Uses arrow keys to navigate fields (up/down)\n- Uses left/right arrow keys to change values\n- Cycles through discrete options or inverts boolean flags\n- Shows real-time scenario summary with effective geometry\n- Provides launch summary showing all computed values\n- Passes selections to `seeded_state_with_full_overrides()` from tank_scenarios crate\n\n---\n\n### SUMMARY\n\n✓ All 5 TUI screens present with required metrics and controls\n✓ Overview, Chemistry, Biology, Actions, and Log screens fully functional\n✓ All 12 actions implemented with proper form fields\n✓ TUI architecture uses snapshot + action dispatch (no direct state mutation)\n✓ All data presets exist: 4 source waters, 4 substrates, 2 plants, 1 shrimp, 1 process default\n✓ All 3 scenarios defined: nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room with full provenance blocks\n✓ Scenarios crate provides fixture system with materialization and override capability\n✓ Startup configuration allows choosing all key parameters before launch\n\nThe implementation is complete and comprehensive."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ae6cb215f71c9ec2d (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 79980\ntool_uses: 34\nduration_ms: 75562</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49fc8440-ef1d-426c-844e-0d9d2eefdcf5","uuid":"9a0e1b07-280c-4bd8-bee3-dc36e2853351","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Thoroughly explore the TUI and data crates at /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_tui/ and /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/. Also check /root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_scenarios/. Verify:\n\n1. **TUI screens**: Must have Overview, Chemistry, Biology, Actions, Log screens\n   - Overview: day/hour, temp, pH, DO, TAN, NH3, nitrite, nitrate, plant status, shrimp status, warnings\n   - Chemistry: che